B.a3o=new A.q1("M\xdcHEND\u0130SL\u0130K \xdcR\xdcN\xdc / HESAPLAMA \xc7ALI\u015eMA ALANI","Teknik, \xf6zenli ve g\xfcvenilir hisseden bir kaynak hesaplay\u0131c\u0131.","Ger\xe7ek kaynak a\u011fz\u0131 geometrisinden, AWS sarf malzemesi se\xe7iminden ve m\xfc\u015fteriye veya \xfcretime sunulabilecek rapor kalitesinde bir sonu\xe7 katman\u0131ndan hesaplama olu\u015fturun.","Aktif birle\u015fim","A\u011f\u0131z","Y\xf6ntem","Oturum \xd6zeti","\xc7izim modu","Sarf malzeme","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u015fablonlar","Hesap durumu","Hesapland\u0131","Hesaplama bekleniyor","G\xfcnl\xfck hesaplama","Kaynak alan\u0131, uzunluk, hacim, kaynak metali, dolgu ihtiyac\u0131, ark s\xfcresi ve dolgu varsay\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fta hesaplay\u0131n.","Teknik \xe7izim","Canl\u0131 a\u011f\u0131z geometrisini g\xf6rsel ve m\xfchendislik modlar\u0131nda g\xf6sterin, kesit \xe7izimi hesaplamay\u0131 desteklesin.","Rapor ak\u0131\u015f\u0131","Canl\u0131 hesaplamay\u0131 net bir m\xfchendislik dayana\u011f\u0131 ve tekrar kullan\u0131labilir \u015fablonlarla PDF'e haz\u0131r bir sonu\xe7 \xf6zetine d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcn.","Ba\u015fla","Dil","sen@ornek.com","Ge\xe7erli bir mail adresi gir","Varyos Weld\u2019e Ho\u015f Geldin","\u015eablonlar\u0131n\u0131 ve raporlar\u0131n\u0131 cihazlar aras\u0131nda saklamak i\xe7in hesap olu\u015ftur, ya da do\u011frudan misafir olarak devam et.","Kay\u0131t Ol","Kay\u0131ts\u0131z Devam Et","Hesab\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015ftur","Ad","Ay\u015fe","Soyad","Y\u0131lmaz","E-posta","Hesap Olu\u015ftur","Ad\u0131n\u0131 gir","Soyad\u0131n\u0131 gir","Ana Sayfa","Dolgu Malzeme T\xfcketimi","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Hesaplamalar","Ana Malzeme","Dolgu Malzeme","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Raporlar","Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131lar","K\xfct\xfcphane","Ge\xe7mi\u015f","Kaydet","Vazge\xe7","Sil","D\xfczenle","Ad gerekli","Ana Malzeme","Hen\xfcz ana malzeme yok. K\xfct\xfcphaneni olu\u015fturmak i\xe7in bir tane ekle.","Ana Malzeme Ekle","Ad","Tan\u0131m/Standart","Notlar","Ana Malzemeyi Sil",'"{name}" ana malzeme k\xfct\xfcphanenden silinsin mi? Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.',"Sac Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131","Sac Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (d, mm)","Min. Sac Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (dmin, mm)","Maks. Sac Kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (dmax, mm)","Dolgu Malzeme","Hen\xfcz dolgu malzeme yok. K\xfct\xfcphaneni olu\u015fturmak i\xe7in bir tane ekle.","Dolgu Malzeme Ekle","Ad","Aile","AWS Spesifikasyonu","Yo\u011funluk (g/cm\xb3)","Notlar","Ge\xe7erli bir yo\u011funluk gir","Dolgu Malzemeyi Sil",'"{name}" dolgu malzeme k\xfct\xfcphanenden silinsin mi? Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.',"\xdcretici Bilgisi","\xdcretici Ad\u0131","Malzeme Kodu","Kimyasal Bile\u015fim","VEYA do\u011frudan CET / Pcm gir","Ge\xe7erli bir say\u0131 gir","Ge\xe7erli aral\u0131kta bir de\u011fer gir","Karbon \xc7eli\u011fi","Paslanmaz \xc7elik","Farkl\u0131 Metal","Al\xfcminyum","D\xfc\u015f\xfck Ala\u015f\u0131ml\u0131 \xc7elik","Nikel Ala\u015f\u0131m\u0131","Bak\u0131r Ala\u015f\u0131m\u0131","D\xf6kme Demir","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Raporlar","Hen\xfcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 rapor yok. Bir PDF d\u0131\u015fa aktard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda burada g\xf6r\xfcnecek.","Payla\u015f","Sil","Raporu Sil",'"{name}" kay\u0131tl\u0131 raporlar\u0131ndan silinsin mi? Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.',"Rapor payla\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. L\xfctfen tekrar dene.","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Hesaplamalar","Hen\xfcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplama yok. Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xf6zet ad\u0131m\u0131ndan birini kaydetti\u011finde burada g\xf6r\xfcnecek.","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 listeni olu\u015fturmak i\xe7in hesaplay\u0131c\u0131da bir hesaplama kaydederek giri\u015f yap.","Y\xfckle","\u015eablonu Yeniden Adland\u0131r","\u015eablon Ad\u0131","\u015eablon yeniden adland\u0131r\u0131lamad\u0131. L\xfctfen tekrar dene.","\u015eablonu Sil",'"{name}" kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplamalar\u0131ndan silinsin mi? Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.',"\u015eablon silinemedi. L\xfctfen tekrar dene.","Kaynak Y\xf6ntemi De\u011fi\u015fsin mi?","Bu ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 \u015fablonu genellikle {presetProcess} kullan\u0131r. Kaynak y\xf6ntemini buna g\xf6re de\u011fi\u015ftir, yoksa {currentProcess} olarak m\u0131 kals\u0131n?","{presetProcess} olarak de\u011fi\u015ftir","{currentProcess} olarak kals\u0131n","\u015eablon kaydedilemedi. L\xfctfen tekrar dene.","\u015eablon kaydedildi.","Sadece bu cihazda kaydedildi \u2014 internete ba\u011flan\u0131nca e\u015fitlenecek.","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplama g\xfcncellendi.","Sadece bu cihazda g\xfcncellendi \u2014 internete ba\u011flan\u0131nca e\u015fitlenecek.","Bu kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplama ba\u015fka bir yerde silinmi\u015fti ve geri y\xfcklendi.","Bu kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplama ba\u015fka bir yerde silinmi\u015fti ve sadece bu cihazda geri y\xfcklendi \u2014 internete ba\u011flan\u0131nca e\u015fitlenecek.","{count} kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplama y\xfcklenemedi ve atland\u0131.","\xd6n Is\u0131tma S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131","So\u011fuma S\xfcresi (t8/5)","Nikel (Ni) %","\xd6n Is\u0131tma S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131","EN 1011-2 Y\xf6ntem B (CET tabanl\u0131)","Ana malzeme kimyasal bile\u015fimi","A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k\xe7a y\xfczde girin; bo\u015f = %0","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Ana Malzemeden y\xfckle","Analiz edilmemi\u015f veya bulunmayan elementleri bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131n \u2014 hesaplamada %0 olarak kabul edilir.","Kaynak metali CET % (iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 \u2014 \xf6zel kural i\xe7in)","Ba\u011flant\u0131 ve i\u015flem","Sac kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (mm)","Dif\xfczyona u\u011frayabilir hidrojen HD (ml/100g, ISO 3690)","\xc7elik akma dayan\u0131m\u0131 (N/mm\xb2, iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131)","\xd6n \u0131s\u0131tma s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 hesapla","\xd6nerilen \xf6n \u0131s\u0131tma s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131","\xd6n \u0131s\u0131tma gerekli de\u011fil","Hesaplanan Y\xf6ntem B de\u011feri: {value} \xb0C (20 \xb0C ortam referans\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131nda).","Tasar\u0131m CET de\u011feri EN 1011-2'nin \xf6zel kural\u0131na g\xf6re %{value} olarak ayarland\u0131 (kaynak metali CET + %0.03).","CET %{value} \u2014 standard\u0131n do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015f %0.2\u20130.5 aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda. Bu sonucu ekstra dikkatle de\u011ferlendirin.","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k {value} mm \u2014 standard\u0131n do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015f 10\u201390 mm aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda.","Dif\xfczyona u\u011frayabilir hidrojen {value} ml/100g \u2014 standard\u0131n do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015f 1\u201320 ml/100g aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda.","Is\u0131 girdisi {value} kJ/mm \u2014 standard\u0131n do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015f 0.5\u20134.0 kJ/mm aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda.","Akma dayan\u0131m\u0131 {value} N/mm\xb2 \u2014 standard\u0131n do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015f 1000 N/mm\xb2 s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerinde.","Bu y\xf6ntem (EN 1011-2 Ek C.3, Y\xf6ntem B) ISO/TR 15608'e g\xf6re \xe7elik gruplar\u0131 1-4 i\xe7in (yayg\u0131n yap\u0131sal ve bas\u0131n\xe7l\u0131 kap \xe7elikleri) do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Y\xfcksek ala\u015f\u0131ml\u0131 veya \xf6zel \xe7elikler i\xe7in bu sonuca g\xfcvenmeden \xf6nce \xe7eli\u011finizin grubunu ayr\u0131ca do\u011frulay\u0131n.","Di\u011fer karbon e\u015fde\u011ferleri (yaln\u0131zca referans)","EN 1011-2'nin par\xe7as\u0131 de\u011fildir \u2014 yaln\u0131zca bilgilendirme ama\xe7l\u0131d\u0131r.","Bu \xf6n \u0131s\u0131tma s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 So\u011fuma S\xfcresi hesaplay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131nda kullan","So\u011fuma S\xfcresi (t8/5) Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131","EN 1011-2 Ek D.6","\xd6n \u0131s\u0131tma / pasolar aras\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131k","\xd6n \u0131s\u0131tma veya pasolar aras\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131k T0 (\xb0C)","500\xb0C'nin alt\u0131nda olmal\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 so\u011fuma form\xfcl\xfc bu de\u011ferde ve \xfczerinde tan\u0131ms\u0131zd\u0131r.","-50\xb0C veya \xfczerinde olmal\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 bu, kaynak i\xe7in fiziksel olarak makul herhangi bir \xf6n \u0131s\u0131tma veya pasolar aras\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n \xe7ok alt\u0131ndad\u0131r.","Is\u0131 girdisi","Ba\u011flant\u0131 ve kal\u0131nl\u0131k","Ba\u011flant\u0131 tipi","Levha \xfczeri paso / plaka \xfczeri paso","Al\u0131n kayna\u011f\u0131 \u2014 pasolar aras\u0131","K\xf6\u015fe kayna\u011f\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\xfcz desteklenmiyor \u2014 EN 1011-2 yaln\u0131zca bir aral\u0131k verir (F2 0.45\u20130.67) ve enterpolasyon kural\u0131 yoktur, bu y\xfczden uygulama bunlar i\xe7in de\u011fer hesaplamaz.","Sac kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (mm)","So\u011fuma s\xfcresini hesapla","So\u011fuma s\xfcresi t8/5","2D ince levha","3D kal\u0131n levha","{regime} form\xfcl\xfc kullan\u0131larak hesapland\u0131 (bu girdiler i\xe7in ge\xe7i\u015f kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131 dt = {dt} mm).","Is\u0131 girdisi {value} kJ/mm \u2014 EN 1011-2 \xf6rnek hesaplar\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfclen tipik 0.5\u20134.0 kJ/mm aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda.","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k {value} mm \u2014 bu hesaplama i\xe7in tipik aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda; girdilerinizi kontrol edin.","Do\u011frudan gir","Ark parametrelerinden hesapla","Net \u0131s\u0131 girdisi Q (kJ/mm)","Kaynak y\xf6ntemi","Gerilim (V)","Ak\u0131m (A)","\u0130lerleme h\u0131z\u0131 (mm/dk)","Hesaplanan Q: {value} kJ/mm","Ark \u0131s\u0131l verimi EN 1011-2'de yaln\u0131zca SAW, SMAW ve GMAW/MAG i\xe7in do\u011frulanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Di\u011fer y\xf6ntemler i\xe7in 'Do\u011frudan gir' se\xe7ene\u011fine ge\xe7ip Q de\u011ferini ba\u015fka bir kaynaktan girin.","Geri","Devam Et","Hesapla","S\u0131f\u0131rla","G\xfcncelle","Tamam","Boru Al\u0131n Kayna\u011f\u0131","Sac Al\u0131n Kayna\u011f\u0131","K\xf6\u015fe Kayna\u011f\u0131","Toplam kaynak uzunlu\u011fu, boru d\u0131\u015f \xe7ap\u0131 x adet \xfczerinden hesaplan\u0131r.","Toplam kaynak uzunlu\u011fu, kaynak diki\u015fi uzunlu\u011fu x adet \xfczerinden hesaplan\u0131r.","K\xf6\u015fe kayna\u011f\u0131 alan\u0131, e\u015fit kenar geometrisine ve girilen kaynak uzunlu\u011funa dayan\u0131r.","Tek V","Yar\u0131m V","\xc7ift V","Bile\u015fik V","K\xfct (Kare)","K\xf6\u015fe","Tahmini","Manuel","E\u015fit","E\u015fit De\u011fil","Merkez Hatt\u0131 Hizalama","D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap Hizalama","\u0130\xe7 \xc7ap Hizalama","G\xf6rsel","Teknik","\xd6zel","CS Boru Tek V / GTAW + SMAW","CS Boru \xc7ift V / GTAW + SMAW","SS Boru Tek V / GTAW","CS Sac Tek V / GMAW","CS Sac \xc7ift V / SMAW","CS K\xf6\u015fe / FCAW","Herhangi bir \u015fablon varsay\u0131m\u0131 uygulanmam\u0131\u015f manuel kurulum.","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi boru k\xf6k pasosu art\u0131 dolgu pasosu ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Kal\u0131n \xe7eperli karbon \xe7eli\u011fi boru \xe7ift V ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Yaln\u0131zca GTAW ile paslanmaz boru ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi sac tek V \xfcretim ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi sac \xe7ift V manuel kaynak ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi yap\u0131sal k\xf6\u015fe kayna\u011f\u0131 ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 kurulumu.","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi masif tel veya dolgu metali","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi GTAW dolgu metali","D\xfc\u015f\xfck hidrojenli karbon \xe7eli\u011fi kapl\u0131 elektrot","Sel\xfclozik karbon \xe7eli\u011fi k\xf6k elektrodu","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi \xf6zl\xfc tel (flux-cored)","308L paslanmaz \xe7elik dolgu metali","308L paslanmaz \xe7elik kapl\u0131 elektrot","316L paslanmaz \xe7elik dolgu metali","Farkl\u0131 metal kaynaklar\u0131 i\xe7in 309L dolgu metali","Farkl\u0131 metal kaynaklar\u0131 i\xe7in 309L kapl\u0131 elektrot","5356 al\xfcminyum dolgu metali","Tipik karbon \xe7eli\u011fi boru k\xf6k ve dolgu kombinasyonu","Rutil, kullan\u0131m\u0131 kolay genel ama\xe7l\u0131 elektrot, AC/DC","Demir tozlu elektrot, y\xfcksek dolgu h\u0131z\u0131, d\xfcz/yatay k\xf6\u015fe kaynaklar\u0131","Karbon \xe7eli\u011fi i\xe7in genel ama\xe7l\u0131 masif GMAW teli","%0.5 Mo ala\u015f\u0131ml\u0131 \xe7elik borular i\xe7in d\xfc\u015f\xfck hidrojenli elektrot","Nikel i\xe7erikli d\xfc\u015f\xfck s\u0131cakl\u0131k \xe7eli\u011fi i\xe7in d\xfc\u015f\xfck hidrojenli elektrot (~%1 Ni)","D\xfc\u015f\xfck s\u0131cakl\u0131k hizmeti i\xe7in nikel i\xe7erikli d\xfc\u015f\xfck ala\u015f\u0131ml\u0131 \xe7elik dolgu","Y\xfcksek s\u0131cakl\u0131k borular\u0131 i\xe7in krom-molibden dolgu","ER316L'nin SMAW kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131","Y\xfcksek s\u0131cakl\u0131k/karb\xfcr \xe7\xf6kelmesine diren\xe7li hizmet i\xe7in niyobyumla stabilize paslanmaz dolgu","\u0130yi ak\u0131\u015f/\xe7atlak direncine sahip genel ama\xe7l\u0131 %5 silisyum al\xfcminyum dolgu","Deniz ve y\xfcksek mukavemetli al\xfcminyum yap\u0131lar i\xe7in y\xfcksek magnezyumlu dolgu","D\xf6kme demir onar\u0131m kayna\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in saf nikele yak\u0131n elektrot","Daha y\xfcksek mukavemetli d\xf6kme demir onar\u0131mlar\u0131 i\xe7in nikel-demir elektrot","Inconel ve farkl\u0131 metal kaynaklar\u0131 i\xe7in nikel-krom \xe7\u0131plak dolgu teli","Nikel-krom-demir elektrot, ERNiCr-3'\xfcn SMAW kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 kullan\u0131m durumu","Bak\u0131r ve lehim-kaynak uygulamalar\u0131 i\xe7in silisyum bronz dolgu","A\u015f\u0131nmaya dayan\u0131kl\u0131 kaplamalar ve farkl\u0131 metal birle\u015fimleri i\xe7in al\xfcminyum bronz elektrot","K\xfct\xfcphanenizden \xf6zel dolgu malzemesi.","Bu \xf6zel malzeme i\xe7in tipik ana malzeme kaydedilmemi\u015f.","Aktif M\xfchendislik Dayana\u011f\u0131","Birle\u015fim Tipi","Eleman Geometrisi","Hizalama Referans\u0131","E\u015fit olmayan elemanlar\u0131n kesit \xe7iziminde nas\u0131l hizaland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mlar.","A\u011f\u0131z Tipi","Kaynak Y\xf6ntemi","Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 \u015eablonu","Birle\u015fim, \xf6l\xe7\xfcler ve kaynak y\xf6ntemi dahil tam bir \xf6rnek kurulum y\xfckler; ard\u0131ndan bunu d\xfczenleyebilirsiniz.","Giri\u015f \u015eablonu","Sarf Malzeme ve Yo\u011funluk","AWS dolgu se\xe7imi, aile bilgisi ve kaynak metali yo\u011funluk esas\u0131.","AWS S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131","Bir AWS dolgu metali s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131 se\xe7in. Yo\u011funluk otomatik olarak doldurulur ve yine de ayarlanabilir.","Malzemelerim"," (kay\u0131tl\u0131 haliyle)","\u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak, bu hesaplaman\u0131n uyguland\u0131\u011f\u0131 ana malzemeyi kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zdan kaydedin.","Belirtilmedi","Se\xe7ilen ana malzeme: {value}","Hen\xfcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 bir ana malzemeniz yok -- burada se\xe7ebilmek i\xe7in Ana Sayfa'daki Ana Malzeme kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan bir tane ekleyin.","k\xf6\u015fe kayna\u011f\u0131 y\xfczeyi","T-birle\u015fimi","SMAW dolgu / kapak","GTAW k\xf6k","\xdcst","Alt","mm bindirme","mm y\xfckseklik","Se\xe7ilen s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma: {value}","Tipik ana malzemeler: {value}","H\u0131z Esas\u0131","Dolgu h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131n tahmini y\xf6ntem varsay\u0131lanlar\u0131ndan m\u0131 yoksa manuel planlama verisinden mi gelece\u011fini se\xe7in.","Tahmini mod, dolgu h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 y\xf6ntem ve dolgu \xe7ap\u0131ndan t\xfcretir. \xd6n hesaplama i\xe7in kullan\u0131n, kalifikasyon seviyesinde planlama i\xe7in de\u011fil.","Tahmini mod, GTAW ve SMAW dolgu h\u0131zlar\u0131n\u0131 se\xe7ilen dolgu \xe7aplar\u0131ndan t\xfcretir, ard\u0131ndan bunlar\u0131 GTAW ge\xe7i\u015f derinli\u011fini kullanarak birle\u015ftirir.","Manuel mod, tahmini h\u0131z\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfclen bir at\xf6lye de\u011feri, proje planlama de\u011feri veya WPS varsay\u0131m\u0131yla ge\xe7ersiz k\u0131lar.","Manuel mod, ark s\xfcresinin planlanan k\xf6k, dolgu ve kapak s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 izlemesi i\xe7in ayr\u0131 GTAW ve SMAW dolgu h\u0131zlar\u0131 girmenizi sa\u011flar.","Giri\u015f Parametreleri","Varsay\u0131lan kabuller: yo\u011funluk {density} g/cm3, fire pay\u0131 %{waste}","Boyutsal Giri\u015fler","Kaynak geometrisi, eleman boyutu, y\xf6ntem \xe7ap\u0131 ve hesaplama kabullerini girin.","Birle\u015fim Tipi ve Geometri","Ana \xd6l\xe7\xfcler","Kapak \xd6l\xe7\xfcleri (opsiyonel)","Hesaplamay\u0131 \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r","Canl\u0131 tahmini yenilemek i\xe7in Hesapla'y\u0131 kullan\u0131n. S\u0131f\u0131rla, varsay\u0131lan m\xfchendislik ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 de\u011ferlerini geri y\xfckler.","\u015eablon Olarak Kaydet","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 Hesaplamay\u0131 G\xfcncelle","PDF d\u0131\u015fa aktarma, ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 bir tahminden sonra etkinle\u015fir; b\xf6ylece rapor her zaman g\xfcncel m\xfchendislik dayana\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yans\u0131t\u0131r.","Tahmin do\u011fru g\xf6r\xfcnd\xfc\u011f\xfcnde rapor paneli, d\xfczenli PDF \xe7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131 i\xe7in haz\u0131rd\u0131r.","Sonu\xe7lar","{process} y\xf6ntemi kendi aktif dolgu verimini ve dolgu h\u0131z\u0131 esas\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r. Birle\u015fimi se\xe7in, giri\u015f parametrelerini g\xf6zden ge\xe7irin, ard\u0131ndan hesaplay\u0131n.","Birle\u015fimi se\xe7in, ard\u0131ndan hesaplamadan \xf6nce GTAW ge\xe7i\u015f derinli\u011fini, GTAW tel \xe7ap\u0131 ve SMAW elektrot \xe7ap\u0131yla birlikte girin.","Giri\u015fleri d\xfczenle","Giri\u015fleri D\xfczenle","Ana Sayfaya D\xf6n","Teknik \xc7izim","Teknik mod, m\xfchendislik tarz\u0131 \xe7izgi kal\u0131nl\u0131klar\u0131, tarama ve \xf6l\xe7\xfc a\xe7\u0131klamalar\u0131 uygular.","G\xf6rsel mod, canl\u0131 birle\u015fim geometrisini izlemeye devam ederken \xe7izimi daha yumu\u015fak tutar.","\xd6zel \xe7ap","\xd6zel \xc7ap (mm)","Tam bir \xe7ap de\u011feri girin.","\u015eablonu Kaydet","\u015eablonu G\xfcncelle","K\u0131sa bir teknik referans ad\u0131 kullan\u0131n.","Bir Hesapla Kaydet","Bu \u015fablonu kaydetmek i\xe7in e-postan\u0131z\u0131 girin. Daha sonra geri almak i\xe7in herhangi bir cihazda ayn\u0131 e-postay\u0131 kullan\u0131n.","Ge\xe7erli bir e-posta girin.","Hesaplama ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. L\xfctfen giri\u015fleri g\xf6zden ge\xe7irin.","{label} ge\xe7erli bir say\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r.","{label} en fazla {max} olmal\u0131d\u0131r.","Adet","Yo\u011funluk","Fire pay\u0131","Adet","Ayn\u0131 kaynaklar\u0131n say\u0131s\u0131.","Uzunluk (mm)","Par\xe7a ba\u015f\u0131na d\xfcz kaynak diki\u015fi uzunlu\u011fu.","Boru D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap\u0131 A (mm)","A eleman\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f \xe7ap\u0131.","Boru D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap\u0131 B (mm)","B eleman\u0131n\u0131n d\u0131\u015f \xe7ap\u0131.","Boru D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap\u0131 (mm)","\xc7evre hesaplamas\u0131nda kullan\u0131lan d\u0131\u015f \xe7ap.","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k A (mm)","A eleman\u0131n\u0131n \xe7eper veya sac kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131.","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k B (mm)","B eleman\u0131n\u0131n \xe7eper veya sac kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131.","K\xf6k Aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 (mm)","K\xf6k a\xe7\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131.","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k (mm)","Ana malzeme kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011f\u0131.","Taraf Ba\u015f\u0131na K\xf6k Y\xfcz\xfc (mm)","Birle\u015fim merkez hatt\u0131n\u0131n her iki taraf\u0131ndaki k\xf6k y\xfcz\xfc.","K\xf6k Y\xfcz\xfc (mm)","Pah ba\u015flamadan \xf6nceki k\xf6k y\xfcz\xfc.","Pah A\xe7\u0131s\u0131 (\xb0)","Derece cinsinden pah a\xe7\u0131s\u0131 olarak dahil edilir.","Birincil A\xe7\u0131 alfa (\xb0)","K\xf6ke yak\u0131n alt pah a\xe7\u0131s\u0131.","\u0130kincil A\xe7\u0131 beta (\xb0)","K\u0131r\u0131lma noktas\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerindeki \xfcst pah a\xe7\u0131s\u0131.","K\u0131r\u0131lma Y\xfcksekli\u011fi h (mm)","K\xf6k y\xfcz\xfcnden pah k\u0131r\u0131lma noktas\u0131na olan mesafe.","Kapak Bind. (mm)","Kapak pasosunun kanal a\u011fz\u0131n\u0131n her iki kenar\u0131ndan ne kadar ta\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 (her iki kenara ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 eklenir). \u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131.","Kapak pasosunun kanal a\u011fz\u0131n\u0131n her iki kenar\u0131ndan ne kadar ta\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 (her iki kenara ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 eklenir). \xc7ift V kayna\u011f\u0131nda bu de\u011fer her iki y\xfczeye de uygulan\u0131r, yani kapak katk\u0131s\u0131 hesaplamada iki kez say\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131.","Kapak Y\xfck. (mm)","Kapak pasosunun ana malzeme y\xfczeyinden ne kadar y\xfckseldi\u011fi. AWS D1.1 tipik takviye: t<=25mm i\xe7in 3mm, 25-50mm i\xe7in 5mm, t>50mm i\xe7in 6mm. \u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131.","Kapak pasosunun ana malzeme y\xfczeyinden ne kadar y\xfckseldi\u011fi. AWS D1.1 tipik takviye: t<=25mm i\xe7in 3mm, 25-50mm i\xe7in 5mm, t>50mm i\xe7in 6mm. \xc7ift V kayna\u011f\u0131nda bu de\u011fer her iki y\xfczeye de uygulan\u0131r, yani kapak katk\u0131s\u0131 hesaplamada iki kez say\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131.","Kenar \xd6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc (mm)","K\xf6\u015fe kayna\u011f\u0131n\u0131n e\u015fit kenar \xf6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc.","GTAW \xd8 (mm)","GTAW dolgu teli \xe7ap\u0131. Yayg\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcler: 1.6, 2.0, 2.4, 3.2 mm.","SMAW \xd8 (mm)","SMAW elektrot \xe7ap\u0131. Yayg\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcler: 2.5, 3.2, 4.0, 5.0 mm.","\xc7ap (mm)","GMAW teli \xe7ap\u0131. Yayg\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcler: 0.8, 1.0, 1.2, 1.6 mm.","\xc7ap (mm)","FCAW teli \xe7ap\u0131. Yayg\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcler: 1.2, 1.6, 2.0 mm.","GTAW Ge\xe7i\u015f Derinli\u011fi (mm)","SMAW'a ge\xe7meden \xf6nce k\xf6k taraf\u0131ndan GTAW ile biriktirilen derinlik.","GTAW Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131 (kg/h)","GTAW k\xf6k b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc i\xe7in kullan\u0131c\u0131 tan\u0131ml\u0131 dolgu h\u0131z\u0131.","SMAW Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131 (kg/h)","SMAW dolgu ve kapak b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc i\xe7in kullan\u0131c\u0131 tan\u0131ml\u0131 dolgu h\u0131z\u0131.","Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131 (kg/h)","At\xf6lye verisine, planlama de\u011ferine veya WPS varsay\u0131m\u0131na dayal\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131 tan\u0131ml\u0131 dolgu h\u0131z\u0131.","Yo\u011funluk (g/cm3)","Kaynak metali y\u0131\u011f\u0131n yo\u011funlu\u011fu. Varsay\u0131lan, se\xe7ilen s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmay\u0131 izler.","Fire Pay\u0131 (%)","U\xe7 kayb\u0131, kesme, s\u0131\xe7rama ve elle\xe7leme i\xe7in pay.","Y\xf6ntem","H\u0131z Esas\u0131","Giri\u015f \u015eablonu","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u015eablon","Birle\u015fim","Geometri","Hizalama","A\u011f\u0131z","S\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma","Dolgu Metali Ailesi","Yo\u011funluk","Fire Pay\u0131","Adet","Par\xe7a Ba\u015f\u0131na Kaynak Uzunlu\u011fu","Boru D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap\u0131","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k A","Kal\u0131nl\u0131k B","Belirleyici Kal\u0131nl\u0131k","D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap A","D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap B","Referans D\u0131\u015f \xc7ap","K\xf6k Aral\u0131\u011f\u0131","K\xf6k Y\xfcz\xfc","Taraf Ba\u015f\u0131na K\xf6k Y\xfcz\xfc","Pah A\xe7\u0131s\u0131","Birincil Pah A\xe7\u0131s\u0131","\u0130kincil Pah A\xe7\u0131s\u0131","K\u0131r\u0131lma Y\xfcksekli\u011fi","Kapak Bindirmesi (her kenardan)","Kapak Y\xfcksekli\u011fi","K\xf6\u015fe Kayna\u011f\u0131 Kenar \xd6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc","Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Tan\u0131ml\u0131 H\u0131z","Tel \xc7ap\u0131","Elektrot \xc7ap\u0131","GTAW Ge\xe7i\u015f Derinli\u011fi","GTAW Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","GTAW Tel \xc7ap\u0131","SMAW Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","SMAW Elektrot \xc7ap\u0131","H\u0131z Esas\u0131","GTAW Ge\xe7i\u015f Derinli\u011fi","ard\u0131ndan SMAW","Dolgu Verimi","E\u015fde\u011fer Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","Kullan\u0131c\u0131 Tan\u0131ml\u0131","Tel","Elektrot","tel","elektrot","E\u015fitsiz Birle\u015fim","Belirleyici Kal\u0131nl\u0131k","birle\u015fim","Birle\u015fim ve \xd6l\xe7\xfcler","Sarf Malzeme ve H\u0131z","Bu kaynak i\xe7in kullan\u0131lacak y\xf6ntemi se\xe7in. Bu, sonraki ad\u0131mlar i\xe7in dolgu varsay\u0131lanlar\u0131n\u0131 ve dolgu se\xe7eneklerini belirler.","G\xf6zden Ge\xe7ir ve Hesapla","A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kurulumu onaylay\u0131n, ard\u0131ndan hesaplay\u0131n. De\u011fi\u015ftirmek i\xe7in herhangi bir ad\u0131m\u0131 d\xfczenleyin.","Y\xf6ntem","\xd6l\xe7\xfcler","Sarf Malzeme","Ad\u0131m {current} / {total}","M\xfchendislik incelemesi, malzeme planlamas\u0131 ve sarf malzeme kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 i\xe7in rapor kalitesinde \xf6zet.","Bu ilk a\u015fama bir planlama tahminidir \u2014 \xfcretime ge\xe7meden \xf6nce kalifiye WPS'inize ve bir test kuponuna g\xf6re do\u011frulay\u0131n.","PDF haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor...","PDF Kilidini A\xe7","PDF D\u0131\u015fa Aktar","TAHM\u0130N HAZIR","Tahmini dolgu metali t\xfcketimi {filler} kg, ark s\xfcresi {arcTime} h.","Etkin H\u0131z","Metre Ba\u015f\u0131na Dolgu","Metre Ba\u015f\u0131na Ark S\xfcresi","Kaynak Alan\u0131","Kaynak Uzunlu\u011fu","Kaynak Metali Hacmi","Kaynak Metali A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131","Dolgu Metali T\xfcketimi","Tahmini Ark S\xfcresi","Etkin Dolgu Verimi","Etkin Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","Bir \xfcst standart kenar \xf6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc ({size}mm), yakla\u015f\u0131k %{percent} daha fazla dolgu gerektirir.","Metre Ba\u015f\u0131na Kaynak Metali","Birle\u015fim Ba\u015f\u0131na Dolgu","Birle\u015fim Ba\u015f\u0131na Ark S\xfcresi","Verim Kayb\u0131 Esas\u0131","Fire Pay\u0131 Esas\u0131","T\xfcketim \xc7arpan\u0131","Y\xf6ntem Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131","Biriken kaynak metali, dolgu ihtiyac\u0131 ve ark s\xfcresinin y\xf6ntem segmentine g\xf6re da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131.","Alan Pay\u0131 %{value}","Kaynak Metali {value} kg","Dolgu T\xfcketimi {value} kg","Ark S\xfcresi {value} h","Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131 {value} kg/h","Dolgu Verimi {value}","M\xfchendislik Dayana\u011f\u0131","Geometri, y\xf6ntem kurulumu, yo\u011funluk ve dolgu varsay\u0131mlar\u0131 dahil bu tahminde kullan\u0131lan tam m\xfchendislik dayana\u011f\u0131.","Planlama G\xf6stergeleri","Birle\u015fim se\xe7eneklerini, i\u015f y\xfck\xfcn\xfc ve sarf malzeme planlama esas\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmaya yard\u0131mc\u0131 normalize edilmi\u015f g\xf6stergeler.","M\xfchendislik Notlar\u0131","Ark s\xfcresi yaln\u0131zca kaynak s\xfcresini kapsar. Montaj, elle\xe7leme, temizlik, yeniden konumland\u0131rma ve muayene dahil de\u011fildir.","Dolgu metali t\xfcketimi, biriken kaynak metalini, y\xf6ntem dolgu verimini ve girilen fire pay\u0131n\u0131 i\xe7erir.","Sarf malzeme s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rmas\u0131, malzeme ailesi ve yo\u011funluk referans\u0131 sa\u011flar. Nihai proje veya m\xfc\u015fteri gereksinimleri her zaman esas al\u0131nmal\u0131d\u0131r.","Bu rapor tahmin ve planlama i\xe7in uygundur. Onayl\u0131 bir WPS, PQR, kaynak\xe7\u0131 kalifikasyonu veya serbest b\u0131rakma belgesi de\u011fildir.","Gizlilik Politikas\u0131","Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015fullar\u0131","Ba\u011flant\u0131 a\xe7\u0131lamad\u0131.","Hesap","Bu uygulamada \u015fifre yoktur -- e-postan\u0131z yaln\u0131zca hesab\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 tan\u0131mlar.","\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap","\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131.","Hesab\u0131 Sil","Bu uygulamay\u0131 misafir olarak kullan\u0131yorsunuz.","Kaydedilmi\u015f hesaplamalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 bu cihaza e\u015fitlemek i\xe7in mevcut hesap e-postan\u0131zla giri\u015f yap\u0131n.","E-posta","Giri\u015f Yap","{email} olarak giri\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131.","Hesap silinsin mi?","Bu i\u015flem sizi \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapt\u0131racak ve kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplamalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 hem bu cihazdan hem de buluttan kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silecektir. Kay\u0131tl\u0131 e-posta adresiniz de sistemlerimizden kald\u0131r\u0131lacakt\u0131r -- bu k\u0131s\u0131m manuel olarak i\u015flenir ve tamamlanmas\u0131 en fazla 30 g\xfcn s\xfcrebilir. Ad\u0131n\u0131z girildiyse yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r ve hi\xe7bir yere g\xf6nderilmez.","Hesab\u0131n\u0131z siliniyor...","Hesap Silindi","Yerel verileriniz ve bulutla e\u015fitlenen kay\u0131tl\u0131 hesaplamalar\u0131n\u0131z kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.","\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131 ve yerel veriler temizlendi, ancak buluttaki baz\u0131 veriler tam olarak kald\u0131r\u0131lamam\u0131\u015f olabilir. Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kontrol edip tekrar deneyin veya destek ile ileti\u015fime ge\xe7in.","Hesap","Misafir","Kay\u0131t olarak","ve","'n\u0131 kabul etmi\u015f olursunuz.","Kaynak Tahmin Raporu","Kaynak sarf malzemesi tahmin raporu","Sayfa {current} / {total}","Y\xf6netici \xd6zeti","M\xfchendislik incelemesi ve at\xf6lye planlamas\u0131 i\xe7in haz\u0131rlanan temel tahmin \xe7\u0131kt\u0131lar\u0131.","Planlama G\xf6stergeleri","Birle\u015fimleri, i\u015f y\xfck\xfcn\xfc ve sarf malzeme talebini kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmak i\xe7in normalize edilmi\u015f performans g\xf6stergeleri.","Y\xf6ntem Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131","Biriken kaynak metalini, dolgu talebini ve ark s\xfcresini y\xf6ntem segmentine g\xf6re g\xf6steren b\xf6l\xfcnm\xfc\u015f tahmin.","M\xfchendislik Dayana\u011f\u0131","Tahmini hesaplamak i\xe7in kullan\u0131lan giri\u015f se\xe7imleri ve belirleyici geometri.","Hesaplama Y\xf6ntemi","Kaynak hacmi, kaynak metali, dolgu t\xfcketimi ve ark s\xfcresi i\xe7in uygulamada kullan\u0131lan form\xfcl dayana\u011f\u0131.","M\xfchendislik Notlar\u0131","Planlama, tahmin ve rapor teslimi i\xe7in pratik yorum notlar\u0131.","Kaynak M\xfchendislik Raporu","M\xfchendislik incelemesi ve at\xf6lye planlamas\u0131 i\xe7in haz\u0131rlanan, kaynak geometrisi, kaynak metali, dolgu metali t\xfcketimi ve y\xf6nteme dayal\u0131 ark s\xfcresinin profesyonel tahmini.","Rapor No: {id}","Olu\u015fturulma {date}","Planlama ve inceleme i\xe7in kaynak geometrisi, kaynak metali, dolgu metali t\xfcketimi ve y\xf6nteme dayal\u0131 ark s\xfcresinin profesyonel tahmini.","RAPOR NO","Olu\u015fturulma","Alan Pay\u0131","Kaynak Metali (kg)","Dolgu (kg)","Ark S\xfcresi (h)","H\u0131z (kg/h)","Verim","Parametre","De\u011fer","Hacim (cm3) = Alan (mm2) x Uzunluk (mm) / 1000","Kaynak Metali (kg) = Hacim (cm3) x Yo\u011funluk (g/cm3) / 1000","Dolgu T\xfcketimi (kg) = Kaynak Metali / Dolgu Verimi x (1 + Fire / 100)","Ark S\xfcresi (h) = Dolgu T\xfcketimi / Dolgu H\u0131z\u0131","Ark s\xfcresi yaln\u0131zca etkin kaynak s\xfcresini kapsar. Montaj, puntalama, pasolar aras\u0131 temizlik, yeniden konumland\u0131rma ve muayene s\xfcresi hari\xe7tir.","Dolgu metali t\xfcketimi, dolgu verimi kayb\u0131n\u0131 ve girilen fire pay\u0131n\u0131 i\xe7erir. Kesin verilen a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k de\u011fil, planlama t\xfcketimi olarak de\u011ferlendirilmelidir.","Birle\u015fik GTAW + SMAW \xe7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131, girilen ge\xe7i\u015f derinli\u011fini kullanarak kaynak metalini ve s\xfcreyi hesaplanan y\xf6ntem pay\u0131na g\xf6re da\u011f\u0131t\u0131r.","Yukar\u0131da kullan\u0131lan dolgu verimi fakt\xf6rleri (SMAW ~%65, FCAW ~%85, GMAW ~%90, GTAW ~%95), Lincoln Electric'in Procedure Handbook of Arc Welding kitab\u0131nda yay\u0131mlanan rakamlarla tutarl\u0131, tipik end\xfcstri aral\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 yans\u0131t\u0131r.","Bu rapor tahmin ve m\xfchendislik planlamas\u0131 i\xe7indir. Onayl\u0131 proje dok\xfcmantasyonu, m\xfc\u015fteri \u015fartnameleri ve \xfcretim kontrolleri her zaman \xf6nceliklidir.","Bu ilk a\u015fama planlama tahminidir - \xfcretimde kullanmadan \xf6nce kalifiye WPS'iniz ve bir test kuponu ile do\u011frulay\u0131n.","Kurulum ve Varsay\u0131mlar","Birle\u015fim Geometrisi","Y\xf6ntem Parametreleri","Di\u011fer","PDF raporu ba\u015far\u0131yla d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131ld\u0131.","PDF d\u0131\u015fa aktarma ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. L\xfctfen tekrar deneyin.","Asistan","Yapay Zeka Asistan\u0131","Yapay Zeka Asistan\u0131","Uygulaman\u0131n hesaplay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 veya genel kaynak standard\u0131 kavramlar\u0131 hakk\u0131nda soru sorun.","Bir soru sorun...","Dolgu/Sarf Malzeme Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131","Dolgu/Sarf Malzeme Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131 ne hesapl\u0131yor ve nas\u0131l kullanmal\u0131y\u0131m?","\xd6n\u0131s\u0131tma Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131","\xd6n\u0131s\u0131tma Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131 ne hesapl\u0131yor ve nas\u0131l kullanmal\u0131y\u0131m?","So\u011fuma S\xfcresi (t8/5) Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131","So\u011fuma S\xfcresi (t8/5) Hesaplay\u0131c\u0131 ne hesapl\u0131yor ve nas\u0131l kullanmal\u0131y\u0131m?","\xc7ok fazla mesaj g\xf6nderildi -- l\xfctfen biraz bekleyip tekrar deneyin.","Bu mesaj g\xf6nderilemedi. L\xfctfen tekrar deneyin.","Asistan yan\u0131t vermekte \xe7ok uzun s\xfcrd\xfc. L\xfctfen tekrar deneyin.","Asistana ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kontrol edip tekrar deneyin.","Asistan \u015fu anda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor. L\xfctfen tekrar deneyin.","Yapay Zeka Asistan\u0131 bir Premium \xf6zelliktir","Hesaplamalar\u0131n\u0131z ve genel kaynak standard\u0131 kavramlar\u0131 hakk\u0131nda yapay zeka asistan\u0131na soru sormak i\xe7in Premium'u a\xe7\u0131n.","Premium'u A\xe7","Sohbete ba\u015flamadan \xf6nce","Mesajlar\u0131n\u0131z bir yan\u0131t olu\u015fturmak i\xe7in \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc taraf bir yapay zeka hizmetine g\xf6nderilir. L\xfctfen hassas ki\u015fisel bilgi payla\u015fmay\u0131n.","Anlad\u0131m")
